去吧，这里常有狼群出没，待会儿等污泥脱落，狼群很快就会闻出我们的味道。”可是??。“回去再细说。”老大拉着还想细看的弟弟快步离开，他们本来是山下的猎户，经常在这一带打猎，但是还没像今天这样两个人就闯进来，虽然用了污泥覆盖全身，可是经过这么折腾，身上的污泥很快就会脱落，就算有再多的疑惑也只能出去再说了。但是这个时候，秦潇正在白虎山的山脚下。他的衣衫被腰带紧紧的束在腰间，一把长剑直直地插在距离他一步之遥的斜上方，还有两坛酒。他的双脚踩在混着泥沙的杂草之中，大风吹在他的身上，阳光洒在他的身上，但是他从里到外都冷好像一块冰。秦潇却仅仅是静静的站着，也不知道过了多久，他慢慢的仰起头，抬起了冰凉的脸，看眼前的巨石，上面刻印着“白虎山”。他今天独自一人除了城门，来到这白虎山。白虎山是凤凰国西边最大的一座山，猎物丰富，却也被狼群独占，所以别名苍狼山。原本只是听闻此山狼群凶恶，深入更是危险，他偏不信，人怎么可能斗不过这畜生。没想到他的一时傲气竟成了葬送部下的利刃。该死。真该死。秦潇盯着静如死水的树林，外表的平静不过是为了掩饰里面的凶险。他不会再犯同样的错误。绝对不会。抬起一坛酒，掀开红盖头，酒香立刻传入口鼻，秦潇举起酒坛子，开口道“我秦潇在此发誓，兄弟们拼命保住秦潇的性命，秦某也绝不苟活，日后定要亲手扫平这白虎山，用此山的狼血敬畏兄弟们的在天之灵。”说完，秦潇将酒坛子里的酒从左到右倒下。再提起另一酒坛子，掀开盖头，一仰头爽快的喝下。酒水顺着嘴角溢出，顺着嘴角一波又一波的刷下，似乎不会有停下来。领口早已浸湿，酒坛子中的酒终于饮完，秦潇将酒坛子往身旁一扔。酒坛子砰地一声碎了。“锵”秦潇快速的拔出长剑，开始在一旁练起剑来。剑锋所到之处，必定折枝去草，秦潇时而飞上树梢，时而翻转于空中，剑身折射出一道道光芒，却不及秦潇眼中杀气犀利。最后秦潇将剑收于后背，额头上已布满细细的汗水，秦潇嘴唇微微泛白，左边的袖子竟被血液浸湿了一片。“大哥，你慢点。”秦潇双耳一动，再次扬起长剑，一个飞身便跃到了树林中，瞥见两个泥人跌跌撞撞的跑过来，他腾空而起，跃到两个泥人面前，长剑直逼两人喉间。被突然出现的秦潇拦住，长剑抵吼，两人吓得脚一软，双双跪地求饶。“大侠饶命，大侠饶命，我们只不过是山脚下的猎户。我们什么都没做啊，大侠饶命。”两人被吓的三魂丢了七魄，拼命的磕头，才几下额头就见了血。秦潇见他们并非练武之人，白虎山下住着许多猎户，这一点他是清楚的，但是他还是冷冷的道“天才破晓不到两柱香，你们便从这里出来，是在糊弄本将军不成？”“将军？”两人互望一眼，再看看秦潇，器宇轩昂，眉清目秀，顿时吓得更加结巴了。“将??将军饶命，小人真的只是猎户而已。只是今日小人的娘子快要临盆，小人本想上山打猎，给娘子补补身子，原本想着清晨野兔子多，没想到追着一只兔子就到了山里，不得已之下才将污泥抹上，消去味道，防止狼群围攻。小人所说句句属实，还请将军饶小人一命。”“是是是，小人随大哥前来打猎。”说着又重重的磕了一个响头，脑中闪过方才所见一切，着实吓了一跳。秦潇见两人言语诚恳，但是其中一个神色有些闪躲，又道“那你们可有见到什么？如实说来。”“小人什么也没看见。”“小人看见了???。”“看见了什么？”秦潇犀利的一瞥，想必这两人定是看见了什么，难道是昨晚的刺客？“说。”“是，小人看见了???一个姑娘。”男子支支吾吾道，小心翼翼的看着秦潇的脸色。脸上虽然被污泥涂满，只露出两只眼睛，男子却还是习惯性的伸手擦汗。“姑娘？”秦潇眉毛微皱，作业的刺客分明是个男子，山中怎么会有姑娘？难道是同党？但是山中野狼甚多，凶狠残暴，他也是亲眼所见，一个姑娘怎么可能在里面相安无事？“敢糊弄本将军，不想活了？”“小人所说千真万确。”两人再次重重的磕头，仔细回想方才所见，道“那姑娘身披雪白狼皮，约莫十七八岁。”“身边还有一群狼，对了，其中还有一匹四五尺高的雪狼，那姑娘就坐在雪狼的身上，身边的狼也都跟着那姑娘。那姑娘不像是人，倒像是狼变成的”男子说的极为真切，挥舞着双手比划“之前听同僚说这山中时常有女人的声音，原以为是糊弄咱们，没想到今日被我兄弟俩瞧见，想来是真的了。”秦潇看向树林深处，里面雾气浓厚，根本瞧不真切。这两个猎人所言弱假，也不会描绘的如此真切，所言若真，那么，这个姑娘真是狼妖所变，还是和昨晚的刺客有关联？这都不重要，秦潇扬起嘴角，像是松了口气，冷冷道“本将军暂且相信你们，待本将军查实，且饶你们一命。”“谢将军。”两人得到宽恕，赶紧磕头谢恩。秦潇不理会两人，转身准备离去，却忽然停下，从腰间掏出一锭银子，丢在地上，一纵身便跳出了树林。“大哥，这??这是银子。”其中一个男子捡起地上的银子，睁大了眼睛，激动不已“将军给我们银子。”“这???。”老大感激的看着秦潇离去的方向，在心底暗自决定，等娘子平安生产，他就一定要去将军府当差，报答这位将军。等等，这位将军叫什么来着？", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/meirenzhiqibutianxia/7.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 5 Mistaken for a Witch The first ray of sunlight in the morning shines through the dense woods and shines on the woman's jade-like transparent skin, making the dense red marks somewhat conspicuous. The first update of the romance time travel book, you only come to the 151+ reading website. \"Hmm\" The moist touch on her face kept disturbing Qi Lin, but she was still unwilling to open her eyes. She reached out and pressed the furry wolf head into her arms, and found a comfortable position to prepare to sleep again, but the guy in her arms didn't seem to cooperate. She twisted her head restlessly and even started to nibble on her shoulder, which made Qi Lin itchy. \"Xiao Bai, stop making trouble, I'm so sleepy.\" Qi Lin pushed Xiao Bai away, put her hand on her forehead, and reluctantly opened her eyes. What caught her eye were several wolf heads. Every wolf looked at her curiously, including Xiao Bai. Qi Lin stiffly twitched the corners of her mouth. Why did she feel like she had done something bad and was caught? bad thing? ! Qi Lin sat up suddenly. One of the wolves was unable to dodge and was hit hard on the chin. It whined in pain. Qi Lin rubbed the wolf's head perfunctorily a few times and tried hard to recall what happened last night. Some fragmented fragments flashed through her head quickly. , but it was enough to turn into thunder, splitting Qi Lin to pieces. Her ears were buzzing, and her mind went blank. The wolves looked at Qi Lin in confusion, thinking they were late. Qi Lin was angry, and some wolves lay on the ground with their whole bodies, looking at Qi Lin aggrievedly. What did she do? What did she do with a strange man? She actually did that kind of thing with a strange man! ! Could it be said that there is such a despicable impulse hidden in her bones? Xiaobai stared at Qi Lin curiously, but found that Qi Lin's eyes were still on the white stone. It had been like this since Qi Lin stood up. It also looked at the white stone horizontally and vertically several times, and smelled it several times. Except for the faint smell of blood, there was nothing else. Qi Lin quietly stared at the only incongruous blood red on the white stone, as if laughing at her casualness. She had to admit that even though her acupuncture points were tapped at the beginning, her movements were restricted, and she was forced, but later she could move, refuse, and resist, she was actually immersed in the beauty of love, and even took the initiative to cater to the man in black. \"Haha?? Hahaha\" Qi Lin looked at the bright red and couldn't help but laugh at herself. That man had magical powers and would make her lose herself. Although she had a cold personality, she was still a normal person. Her body's needs were often beyond her imagination, so she just regarded it as a sexual dream or a love affair. After thinking clearly, Qi Lin raised her hand and patted her face a few times. The wolves were so surprised that they all looked at her. Qi Lin smiled heartily, \"Let's go, go home.\" \"Ouch?\" The wolves looked at me and I looked at you. They didn't know what happened to Qi Lin. But seeing Qi Lin in a better mood, they started to howl along with her. Qi Lin jumped on Xiao Bai's back, looked back at the stone, and secretly remembered the geographical location here. Then leave. She knew that she might never see that person again, but looking at her intact clothes, Qi Lin's burden was a little less. At least, he helped her put on clothes. In her mind, she vaguely remembered that when she was experiencing the most painful pain for the first time in her life, that person seemed to have said something in her ear. \"Take it easy\" Take it easy. For Qi Lin, who was born in the 21st century, she understands how much care it takes for a man to comfort a woman in this situation. If this person is still there, maybe??? Haha, nothing can be changed. Qi Lin lay helplessly on Xiao Bai's body. What on earth was she thinking? Everything is in chaos, and you actually have expectations for a stranger who has left nothing behind? So naive, so ridiculous. They have no possibility. If this is just an acquaintance and we will never see each other again, then let him turn into a dream and go with the wind. Most of the wolves left, and the little wolf who was catching fish in the water hurried to catch up, but accidentally slipped, got up again, shook off the water on his body, and chased after him, but he always felt that there was something else here. He stopped to take a closer look, but heard the calls of other wolves, so he had to give up and walk away. \"Brother, are you all gone?\" A trembling voice came out weakly in the grass. \"Well, they're all gone.\" \"Brother, why is that girl with the wolves?\" The man raised his head slightly, touched the mud on his face, and patted the person in front of him. \"Could it be a monster?\" \"I think so.\" Another man looked at it carefully. After making sure that the wolves would not come back, he slowly came out of the grass and walked to the white stone where Qi Lin was sitting just now. He looked at it. The white stone was smooth and bright, except for one place that had a little more red. I guess that was what the girl was looking at just now. Is there any profound meaning? But he looked at it for a long time and still didn't see anything. \"Second brother, let's go back quickly. Wolves often appear here. When the mud falls off later, the wolves will smell us soon.\" But??. \"We'll talk more about it when we get back.\" The boss quickly pulled his younger brother who still wanted to take a closer look and left quickly. They were originally hunters at the foot of the mountain and often hunted in this area, but two people didn't break in like today. Although they were covered with mud, the mud on their bodies would soon fall off after such a toss. No matter how many doubts they had, they could only go out and talk. But at this time, Qin Xiao was at the foot of Baihu Mountain. His clothes were tightly tied around his waist with a belt, and a long sword was inserted diagonally above him a step away from him, as well as two jars of wine. His feet stepped on the weeds mixed with mud and sand, the strong wind blew on him, and the sun shone on him, but he was as cold as a piece of ice from the inside out. Qin Xiao just stood quietly. He didn't know how long it took. He slowly raised his head and raised his head.", "title_en": "Chapter 7"}